= Using the resourcepool class =

The [../classes/html/classresourcepool.html resourcepool class] provides a pool of objects.  Objects can be borrowed from and returned to the pool.

The pool contains a configurable minimum number of objects that are allocated when the pool is initialized.  When all of those objects have been borrowed, the pool can allocate a configurable number of additional objects on-demand, up to a configurable maximum.

The pool is a template class, parameterized by the type of object it contains.

The resourcepool class is targeted for use with the MVC classes, but it can be used in non-MVC projects as well.

